1
00:00:00,974 --> 00:00:02,944
I just want to apologize
for being so rude

2
00:00:02,943 --> 00:00:04,273
(Emily:)the other day
in my office.

3
00:00:04,277 --> 00:00:05,807
No, no. No need to apologize.

4
00:00:05,812 --> 00:00:07,442
(Raj:)Excuse me,
can I say something?

5
00:00:07,447 --> 00:00:09,647
(Raj:)I just love both you guys,

6
00:00:09,649 --> 00:00:11,649
(Raj:)and I want you
to get along.

7
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:14,021
And when I say "love,"
I meant as a friend.

8
00:00:15,188 --> 00:00:17,818
(Raj:)And, uh, way
too soon, right?

9
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:21,029
(Penny:)Okay, sit down.
Listen, Emily,

10
00:00:21,027 --> 00:00:22,557
(Penny:)what happened
between me and Raj

11
00:00:22,562 --> 00:00:24,062
(Penny:)was a long time ago.
It was,

12
00:00:24,064 --> 00:00:25,464
(Raj:)and I may have
made it seem

13
00:00:25,465 --> 00:00:27,095
(Raj:)like a bigger deal
than I should have.

14
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,630
(Penny:)Yeah, and Leonard and I
are engaged now,

15
00:00:28,635 --> 00:00:30,935
(Penny:)and I'm just hoping we can put
this whole thing behind us.

16
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:32,437
(Emily:)Mm. I'd like that, too.

17
00:00:32,439 --> 00:00:34,609
(Emily:)Yeah, I thought
I'd be okay with it,

18
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:36,807
(Emily:)but then I saw
how pretty you are.

19
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,440
(Penny:)Oh, that's so sweet.

20
00:00:38,445 --> 00:00:40,575
(Penny:)I mean, look at you--
you are gorgeous.

21
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:44,280
(Raj:)It's true--
you're both gorgeous.

22
00:00:44,284 --> 00:00:46,954
(Raj:)Kind of says something about
the man who could bed you both.

23
00:00:46,953 --> 00:00:49,253
(chuckles)

24
00:00:53,460 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)You get why I've been alone
most of my adult life.

